WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,280
Collect 88 million accounts in ten years

2
00:00:01,280 --> 00:00:03,320
I don’t know what you think. No need to say more.

3
00:00:03,320 --> 00:00:04,600
The basement has a solid structure

4
00:00:04,600 --> 00:00:06,960
As long as it can hold a large safe, boss

5
00:00:06,960 --> 00:00:08,200
You spend all your money on a dresser

6
00:00:08,200 --> 00:00:09,920
Just to use it as a warehouse, full payment

7
00:00:09,920 --> 00:00:13,020
Directly swipe your card to complete the transfer procedures

8
00:00:13,020 --> 00:00:14,730
Eight million days

9
00:00:14,730 --> 00:00:16,890
Full payment for the room, my God

10
00:00:16,890 --> 00:00:18,410
This customer is too powerful

11
00:00:18,410 --> 00:00:19,890
Not even a penny of the price was paid back

12
00:00:19,890 --> 00:00:21,130
Xu Lan’s single commission

13
00:00:21,130 --> 00:00:23,050
Just over two million, boss

14
00:00:23,050 --> 00:00:24,730
It's like a fairyland here

15
00:00:24,730 --> 00:00:25,690
We stay here tonight

16
00:00:25,690 --> 00:00:26,850
Is it okay to stay overnight?

17
00:00:26,850 --> 00:00:28,010
You go treasure hunting tomorrow

18
00:00:28,010 --> 00:00:29,290
This night is not bad either.

19
00:00:29,290 --> 00:00:30,370
Don’t you still want to go to Juzu?

20
00:00:30,370 --> 00:00:31,370
Are you looking at your sister?

21
00:00:31,370 --> 00:00:33,610
Accompanying the boss is more important than anything else, my sister’s affairs

22
00:00:33,610 --> 00:00:34,930
There's no time to do it tomorrow

23
00:00:34,930 --> 00:00:36,210
Just the two of us tonight

24
00:00:36,210 --> 00:00:38,850
Enjoy this suit, okay?

25
00:00:38,850 --> 00:00:40,980
It’s up to you, Mr. Zhang

26
00:00:40,980 --> 00:00:41,940
All transfer agreements

27
00:00:41,940 --> 00:00:43,660
They're all gone. The green knife is ready for mixing.

28
00:00:43,660 --> 00:00:45,460
Here are your cards and keys

29
00:00:45,460 --> 00:00:48,100
Thank you for your hard work, Director Zhang

30
00:00:48,100 --> 00:00:50,080
Do you have any plans tonight?

31
00:00:50,080 --> 00:00:51,120
Living alone in such a big place
